            "answer": {
              "short": "He subtracted 6 from both sides instead of adding 6.",
              "worked": "Subtracting 6 does not undo subtracting 6. He should add 6 to both sides to isolate $k$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 17
