            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "Substitute $k=-3$ back into the equation.",
              "worked": "Substitute $k=-3$ into $k-6=3$:\n$$-3-6=-9\\ne3.$$\nThe two sides are unequal, so $-3$ is not a solution.",
